;; Recursive join3 exercise: all three edge occurrences are dynamic, producing
;; the FULL/FULL, FULL/OLD, and OLD/OLD action views across driver versions.

table (edge int int)

rule
(edge 1 2)
(edge 2 3)
(edge 1 3)
(edge 3 4)
(edge 1 4)
(edge 2 4)

rule (edge A B) (edge B C) (edge A C) --> (edge C A)
